        <h1>Best Sleep Schedule for <span class="pop">Night Shift Workers</span></h1>
        <p class="post-meta">
          <time datetime={publishDate}>5 June 2026</time> &#183; 9 min read
        </p>
        <p class="article-intro">
          Night shift workers are the one group for whom almost every mainstream sleep article is useless. The advice was written for people sleeping when it&#8217;s dark. Here&#8217;s the system that accounts for the biology you&#8217;re actually dealing with &#8212; anchor sleep, strategic light, and timed caffeine.
        </p>
      </header>

      <img
        class="hero-img"
